up the cables"},"do":[{"p":"bridgeOutline","v":"hide"},{"p":"car","v":"leave","w":"weight","d":4},{"p":"weight","v":"show","w":"weight"}],"shots":[{"focus":["car","bridge"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"bridge","does":"both towers tip inward, pulled by the cables"},"state":{"text":"TIPPING","w":"tip"},"do":[{"p":"weight","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"pull","v":"show","w":"pull"},{"p":"bridge","v":"tip","w":"pull"}],"shots":[{"focus":["bridge"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix2","shows":{"p":"anchorL","does":"concrete anchors appear on both banks, back cables tie to the tower tops, towers stand straight"},"do":[{"p":"pull","v":"hide","w":"So"},{"p":"anchorL","v":"show","w":"anchors"},{"p":"anchorR","v":"show","w":"anchors"},{"p":"anchorL","v":"anchor","w":"anchors"},{"p":"anchorR","v":"anchor","w":"anchors"},{"p":"bridge","v":"tipBack","w":"anchors","o":0.2}],"shots":[{"focus":["anchorL","anchorR","bridge"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"bridge","does":"wind arrows blow and the thin deck twists over"},"state":{"text":"TWISTING","w":"twist"},"do":[{"p":"light","v":"storm","w":"wind"},{"p":"wind","v":"show","w":"wind"},{"p":"bridge","v":"twist","w":"twist"}],"shots":[{"focus":["bridge.deck"],"width":0.55}]},{"s":"fix3","shows":{"p":"bridge","does":"deep steel trusses appear along both sides of the deck and it lies flat again"},"do":[{"p":"bridge","v":"truss","w":"truss"},{"p":"bridge","v":"twistBack","w":"truss"},{"p":"wind","v":"hide","w":"truss","o":0.4},{"p":"light","v":"clear","w":"truss"}],"shots":[{"focus":["bridge.deck"],"width":0.55}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"bridge","does":"rails and a tall lamp appear on the bridge"},"do":[{"p":"bridge","v":"rails","w":"rails"},{"p":"lamp","v":"show","w":"complete","autoW":{"w0":"lamp","o0":-0.7}}],"shots":[{"focus":["bridge","lamp"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","shows":{"p":"car2","does":"the car drives off over the finished bridge"},"do":[{"p":"car2","v":"arrive"},{"p":"car2","v":"leave","w":"built","o":0.2}],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"audio":{"cards":[{"text":"60,000 TONS","at":{"s":"fix2","w":"60,000"},"d":1.6},{"text":"1940","at":{"s":"problem3","w":"1940"},"d":1.4}],"sfx":[{"lib":"water_rush","at":{"s":"hook","w":"river"},"d":1.4},{"lib":"dirt","at":{"s":"problem","w":"snaps"},"d":0.9},{"lib":"dirt","at":{"s":"fix2","w":"anchors"},"d":1}],"chimes":[{"s":"name"},{"s":"fix2","w":"60,000"},{"s":"problem3","w":"1940"},{"s":"congrats"}]},"codeShots":true,"why":"A plank over a river in the cut becomes a suspension bridge built step by step: the plank snaps, towers and cables hang the deck, the cables tip the towers until anchors tie them back, and wind twists the deck until a truss stiffens it. The camera opens on the plank over the river, stays side-on on the whole bridge for the towers and cables, widens to take in the anchors, and holds on the deck for the twist and the truss.","hold":true},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you lay a plank across a wide river, you have a bridge."},{"role":"problem","text":"But a car rolls on, and the long plank snaps."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you build two towers and hang the deck from steel cables."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a suspension bridge."},{"role":"how","text":"The car's weight hangs on the cables, and they carry it to the towers."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But now the cables pull so hard that both towers tip inward."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you tie the cables back to concrete anchors of about 60,000 tons each."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But now wind makes the deck twist, like the Tacoma Narrows Bridge in 1940."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you stiffen the deck with a deep steel truss."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add rails and a tall lamp to complete it."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a suspension bridge."}]}